    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατασκελετ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reduce to a skeleton</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.7d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σῶμα</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				153
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be wasted away, 'desiccated</i>,' 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ περιιδεῖν τὴν φύσιν -ευθεῖσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					15.268
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.198
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.5
			</span></i> (
				Act.
			), <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				8.41
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ φυσικὰ ἔργα ταῖς τεχνολογίαις
					-ευόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					2.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
